<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>经络 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%9C/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 10:45:24 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%9C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>藏府经络先后病脉证第一</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-01/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 10:55:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-01/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;杂病的范围牵扯很广，但是所有的方子基础都在伤寒论，所以一定要有伤寒论做为基础，伤寒论的观念是同症同治。金匮就是因为病的种类比较多，症状又都不一样，但是诊断方式还是以阴阳表里虚实寒热八纲辨症为主，处方也是用阴阳表里虚实寒热来区分，但还是同症同治。在刚开始介绍杂病的时候，张仲景就讲了一些内经的理论。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>